# Build context for the C# API is the repo root. Keep the context small and avoid
# leaking build outputs / secrets / the other stacks into the image layer.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.git/

# Host-installed node modules and prior Vite output. The image runs `npm ci` itself, so
# copying these in would both bloat the context and risk shipping win32-native binaries.
**/node_modules/
web-admin/dist/

# Other stacks — not part of the API image.
mobile/
server/
spike/
docs/

# Local env / secrets. `.env.local` matters here beyond secrets: Vite would read it during
# the image build and bake a localhost API URL into the dashboard bundle.
**/.env
**/*.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem

# Editor / OS cruft
**/.DS_Store
**/*.user
